keb.jp/@Banana_Takemura/works/6)\n\nThe man in blue will be in the middle with a smile, the girl in blue will be to the right of him, and the blonde will be to the left. This time the girl in blue will be wearing the outfit from this reference (https://skeb.jp/@if959u/works/476) while the blonde will now have the hair color and outfit from the twitter link above.\n\nThe brunette in the cream colored sweater will be on the top right, the man in green will be on the top left, and the man in black will be at the top center with double peace signs. Transparent or Royal blue background. Thank you!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Banana_Takemura/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 257597, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/38e1307c/uploads/origins/77f16d27-3e90-4fea-8ace-24a17a21abfe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=973352845904ef18694f2c2551c1a70c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/38e1307c/uploads/origins/77f16d27-3e90-4fea-8ace-24a17a21abfe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=973352845904ef18694f2c2551c1a70c, https://si.imgix.net/38e1307c/uploads/origins/77f16d27-3e90-4fea-8ace-24a17a21abfe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb00e5683bbb952872482ab91959eee7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/38e1307c/uploads/origins/77f16d27-3e90-4fea-8ace-24a17a21abfe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f600b7e698e49fe872f61fdfd8bd973f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/38e1307c/uploads/origins/77f16d27-3e90-4fea-8ace-24a17a21abfe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2140284725064cd3f0bb2ad11de1dcf1", "srcset": "https://si.