a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=db871254a58801dde043459c7a701807 2x, https://si.imgix.net/00f3709c/uploads/origins/d7d31304-7195-4022-a1a1-d31788d8a0a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8d46113addf3c065768b707176137d84 3x"}, "body": "Hello again! I was hoping you could draw another video thumbnail for me similar to my last request. \n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Banana_Takemura/works/3\n\nIn this, there will be technically 4 characters but 3 are the main focus. \n\nhttps://twitter.com/_soulart_/status/1426745710326820864?s=21\n\nThe boy in the blue shirt and glasses from my last request returns here making a double peace pose with a confident smirk. He is 23 years old. Here’s another reference if needed though the jacket is black not blue.\nhttps://twitter.com/cloubeau97/status/1598915565128941570\n\nNext, the girl with brown hair and green eyes is to the left winking and blowing a kiss to the camera. She is 22 years old.\n\nThe boy in green is to the right sighing with a smile as he looks towards the two of them. He is also 22.\n\nLastly the boy in black is in the background further behind as if the other 3 started taking the photo without him. He is 21 years old.", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Banana_Takemura/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 257597, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/dce539c8/uploads/origins/206f41ca-0730-43f8-8401-958eb5199f0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1514ac946bb1076451ae1da9ced55ce6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dce539c8/uploads/origins/206f41ca-0730-43f8-8401-958eb5199f0f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1514ac946bb1076451ae1da9ced55ce6, https://si.imgix.net/dce539c